msgid "<strong>Use case</strong>"
msgstr "<strong>ກໍລະນີນຳໃຊ້ຕົວຈິງ</strong>"

#. module: food_distribution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:food_distribution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"A good practice might be to keep those forecasts up to date for the coming "
"months with\n"
"          your sales, so that the manufacturing team plans at best the "
"production at all time\n"
"          accordingly!"
msgstr ""
"ວິທີການທີ່ດີແມ່ນຄວນປັບປຸງການຄາດຄະເນຍອດຂາຍສຳລັບເດືອນຕໍ່ໆໄປໃຫ້ເປັນປັດຈຸບັນຢູ່ສະເໝີ,\n"
"          ເພື່ອໃຫ້ທີມງານຜະລິດສາມາດວາງແຜນການຜະລິດໄດ້ດີທີ່ສຸດຕະຫຼອດເວລາ\n"
"          ຢ່າງສອດຄ່ອງກັນ!"

#. module: food_distribution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:food_distribution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Activate the Food &amp; Drinks Labels settings in the Food Distribution "
"section."
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ ສະຫຼາກອາຫານ &amp; ເຄື່ອງດື່ມ ໃນສ່ວນການແຈກຢາຍອາຫານ."

#. module: food_distribution
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:food_distribution.field_x_nutritional_facts_active
msgid "Active"
msgstr "ເປີດໃຊ້ງານ"

#. module: food_distribution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:food_distribution.welcome_article_body
msgid "Add some Salt and Sugar to secure suppliers for longer on those sides."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມເກືອ ແລະ ນ້ຳຕານ ເພື່ອຈັດຫາຜູ້ສະໜອງໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າໃນໄລຍະຍາວ."

#. module: food_distribution
#: model:x_nutritional_facts,x_name:food_distribution.x_nutritional_facts_4
msgid "Added Sugar"
msgstr "ນ້ຳຕານທີ່ເພີ່ມເຂົ້າ"

#. module: food_distribution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:food_distribution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"All Manufacturing Orders here are Ready to manufacture by default but you "
"can play with\n"
"        the filters at top right of the screen to see them all."
msgstr ""
"ໃບສັ່ງຜະລິດທັງໝົດຢູ່ນີ້ແມ່ນ ພ້ອມຜະລິດ ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ແຕ່ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້\n"
"        ຕົວກັ່ນຕອງຢູ່ມຸມຂວາເທິງຂອງໜ້າຈໍເພື່ອເບິ່ງທັງໝົດໄດ້."

#. module: food_distribution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:food_distribution.welcome_article_body
msgid "Also order the Mayonnaise so you can fill those buckets with sauce."
msgstr "ສັ່ງຊື້ມາຢອນເນສນຳດ້ວຍ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດບັນຈຸຊອດລົງໃນຖັງເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນໄດ້."

#. module: food_distribution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:food_distribution.x_nutritional_facts_search_view
msgid "Archived"
msgstr "ເກັບໄວ້ແລ້ວ"

#. module: food_distribution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:food_distribution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"As a result, a single MO includes all manufacturing needs for the coming "
"days, ensuring customers will be delivered fresh products while you batch "
"their production!"
msgstr ""
"ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ໃບສັ່ງຜະລິດ (MO) ດຽວຈະຮວມຄວາມຕ້ອງການຜະລິດທັງໝົດສຳລັບມື້ຕໍ່ໆໄປ, "
"ຮັບປະກັນວ່າລູກຄ້າຈະໄດ້ຮັບສິນຄ້າທີ່ສົດໃໝ່ ໃນຂະນະທີ່ທ່ານລວມການຜະລິດເປັນຊຸດ!"

#. module: food_distribution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:food_distribution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"As an Inventory Manager you need to make sure that the production team never "
"runs out of\n"
"          supply!"
msgstr ""
"ໃນຖານະຜູ້ຈັດການສາງ, ທ່ານຕ້ອງຮັບປະກັນວ່າທີມງານຜະລິດຈະບໍ່ຂາດເຂີນ\n"
"          ວັດຖຸດິບຢ່າງເດັດຂາດ!"

#. module: food_distribution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:food_distribution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Assuming you received some ingredients and weeks after the supplier notifies "
"you of a quality alert about the lot PLE-001 of pasteurized liquid eggs."
msgstr ""
"ສົມມຸດວ່າທ່ານໄດ້ຮັບວັດຖຸດິບ ແລະ ຫຼາຍອາທິດຕໍ່ມາ ຜູ້ສະໜອງໄດ້ແຈ້ງເຕືອນຄຸນນະພາບກ່ຽວກັບຊຸດ PLE-001 "
"ຂອງໄຂ່ແຫຼວຜ່ານການຂ້າເຊື້ອ."

#. module: food_distribution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:food_distribution.food_distribution_inherit_report_lot_label
msgid "B.b."
