msgid ""
"The Bill of Material is accessible from the Manufacturing App Products menu."
msgstr "ໂຄງສ້າງສິນຄ້າ (BoM) ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ຈາກເມນູ ສິນຄ້າ ໃນແອັບການຜະລິດ."

#. module: food_distribution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:food_distribution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"The Dates section allows you to detail the expiration dates of your products."
msgstr "ສ່ວນ ວັນທີ ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດລະບຸລາຍລະອຽດວັນໝົດອາຍຸຂອງສິນຄ້າຂອງທ່ານໄດ້."

#. module: food_distribution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:food_distribution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"The Mixing tank work center is configured with setup and cleanup time. Take "
"advantage of\n"
"          this capability to optimize your operations!"
msgstr ""
"ສູນປະຕິບັດງານຖັງປະສົມ ໄດ້ຖືກກຳນົດຄ່າພ້ອມເວລາຕິດຕັ້ງ ແລະ ເວລາທຳຄວາມສະອາດ. ໃຊ້\n"
"          ປະໂຫຍດຈາກຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ເພື່ອເພີ່ມປະສິດທິພາບການເຮັດວຽກຂອງທ່ານ!"

#. module: food_distribution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:food_distribution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"The last 3 MO capture recent confirmed orders for potato salads with a start "
"date allowing to manufacture just in time."
msgstr ""
"ໃບສັ່ງຜະລິດ 3 ໃບຫຼ້າສຸດສະແດງຄຳສັ່ງຊື້ທີ່ຢືນຢັນແລ້ວສຳລັບສະຫຼັດມັນຝະລັ່ງ "
"ພ້ອມວັນທີເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຜະລິດໄດ້ທັນເວລາພໍດີ."

#. module: food_distribution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:food_distribution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"The nutritional fact list is available from the Inventory App, Configuration "
"menu."
msgstr "ລາຍການຂໍ້ມູນໂພຊະນາການສາມາດເບິ່ງໄດ້ຈາກ ແອັບສາງສິນຄ້າ, ເມນູ ການກຳນົດຄ່າ."

#. module: food_distribution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:food_distribution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"The products from the Replenishment Rules you triggered are here but not all "
"products have\n"
"        Replenishment Rules at this stage. For some products or other "
"suppliers you need, you can\n"
"        chose to add them manually to a Purchase Order and even create new "
"Purchase Orders."
msgstr ""
"ສິນຄ້າຈາກກົດການຕື່ມສະຕັອກທີ່ທ່ານເອີ້ນໃຊ້ແມ່ນຢູ່ທີ່ນີ້ ແຕ່ຍັງບໍ່ແມ່ນທຸກສິນຄ້າທີ່ຈະມີ\n"
"        ກົດການຕື່ມສະຕັອກໃນຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້. ສຳລັບບາງສິນຄ້າ ຫຼື ຜູ້ສະໜອງອື່ນໆທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການ, ທ່ານສາມາດ\n"
"        ເລືອກເພີ່ມດ້ວຍຕົນເອງໃສ່ໃນໃບສັ່ງຊື້ ແລະ ສາມາດສ້າງໃບສັ່ງຊື້ໃໝ່ໄດ້ອີກດ້ວຍ."

#. module: food_distribution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:food_distribution.welcome_article_body
msgid "Then go to the Operations &gt; Scrap menu and create a new entry."
msgstr "ຈາກນັ້ນໄປທີ່ເມນູ ການດຳເນີນງານ &gt; ສິນຄ້າເສຍຫາຍ ແລ້ວສ້າງລາຍການໃໝ່."

#. module: food_distribution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:food_distribution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"There is some stock of Buckets and Dispensers so no need to order some for "
"the ongoing\n"
"        period.<br/>However, you need to order Mayonnaise Buckets to meet "
"your forecast!"
msgstr ""
"ຍັງມີສະຕັອກຖັງ ແລະ ຫົວຈ່າຍຢູ່ ຈຶ່ງບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງສັ່ງຊື້ສຳລັບ\n"
"        ໄລຍະນີ້.<br/>ເຖິງຢ່າງໃດກໍຕາມ, "
"ທ່ານຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງສັ່ງຖັງມາຢອນເນສເພື່ອໃຫ້ບັນລຸຕາມການຄາດຄະເນຂອງທ່ານ!"

#. module: food_distribution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:food_distribution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"There now is a smart button at the top of the Purchase Order to reach the "
"associated\n"
"        delivery. Hit the Deliveries smart button to open the delivery."
msgstr ""
"ຕອນນີ້ມີປຸ່ມລັດຢູ່ດ້ານເທິງຂອງໃບສັ່ງຊື້ເພື່ອເຂົ້າເຖິງການຈັດສົ່ງ\n"
"        ທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ. ກົດປຸ່ມລັດ ການຈັດສົ່ງ ເພື່ອເປີດລາຍການຈັດສົ່ງ."

#. module: food_distribution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:food_distribution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"These all go free in your current subscription; feel free to explore! 🙃"
msgstr ""
"ສິ່ງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ທັງໝົດລວມຢູ່ໃນແພັກເກດສະມາຊິກປັດຈຸບັນຂອງທ່ານໂດຍບໍ່ເສຍຄ່າ; ສາມາດທົດລອງນຳໃຊ້ໄດ້ຕາມໃຈ! 🙃"

#. module: food_distribution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:food_distribution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"This is great but you might be producing more Mayonnaise than you planned to "
"package..."
msgstr "ນີ້ເປັນເລື່ອງທີ່ດີ ແຕ່ທ່ານອາດຈະຜະລິດມາຢອນເນສຫຼາຍກວ່າທີ່ທ່ານວາງແຜນຈະບັນຈຸ..."

#. module: food_distribution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:food_distribution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"This setup relies on Odoo's standard MTO capability: Potato Fresh Salad "
"operation routes include the MTO route."
msgstr ""
"ການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້ແມ່ນອີງໃສ່ຄຸນສົມບັດ MTO ມາດຕະຖານຂອງ Odoo: ເສັ້ນທາງການດຳເນີນງານຂອງສະຫຼັດມັນຝະລັ່ງສົດ "
"ແມ່ນຮວມມີເສັ້ນທາງ MTO ນຳດ້ວຍ."

#. module: food_distribution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:food_distribution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"To bundle MO expected on close dates, select them from the list and fire the "
"Merge command from the Actions menu."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອຮວມໃບສັ່ງຜະລິດ (MO) ທີ່ມີວັນທີໃກ້ຄຽງກັນເຂົ້າກັນ, ໃຫ້ເລືອກພວກມັນຈາກລາຍການ ແລ້ວກົດຄຳສັ່ງ ຮວມ "
"ຈາກເມນູ ການກະທຳ."

#. module: food_distribution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:food_distribution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"To save time and prevent mistake of typo in the Lot inputs, you might want "
"to work with <strong>Barcode\n"
"          App</strong>!"
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອປະຢັດເວລາ ແລະ ປ້ອງກັນຄວາມຜິດພາດໃນການພິມເລກຊຸດ, ທ່ານອາດຈະຕ້ອງການເຮັດວຽກກັບ "
"<strong>ແອັບ\n"
"          ບາໂຄດ</strong>!"

#. module: food_distribution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:food_distribution.res_config_settings_form_view_inherited
msgid "Traceability"
msgstr "ການຕິດຕາມຍ້ອນກັບ"

#. module: food_distribution
#: model:product.template,name:food_distribution.product_template_15
msgid "Tub 250g"
msgstr "ກະປຸກ 250g"

#. module: food_distribution
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:food_distribution.field_x_nutritional_facts_unit
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:food_distribution.field_x_product_template_nutritional_fact_unit
msgid "Unit"
msgstr "ໜ່ວຍ"

#. module: food_distribution
#: model:sale.order.template,name:food_distribution.sale_order_template_2
msgid "Units of Mayo"
msgstr "ຈຳນວນໜ່ວຍມາຢອນເນສ"

#. module: food_distribution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:food_distribution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Use the <strong>\n"
"          <font class=\"text-o-color-1\">Maintenance App</font>\n"
"        </strong> to keep all your work\n"
"        centers up and running."
msgstr ""
"ນຳໃຊ້ <strong>\n"
"          <font class=\"text-o-color-1\">ແອັບບຳລຸງຮັກສາ</font>\n"
"        </strong> ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສູນປະຕິບັດງານທັງໝົດ\n"
"        ຂອງທ່ານພ້ອມໃຊ້ງານຢູ່ສະເໝີ."

#. module: food_distribution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:food_distribution.welcome_article_body
msgid "Validate the delivery to your customer to complete the job."
msgstr "ກວດສອບຢືນຢັນການຈັດສົ່ງໃຫ້ລູກຄ້າຂອງທ່ານເພື່ອສຳເລັດວຽກ."

#. module: food_distribution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:food_distribution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Validate the scrap order ensuring total isolation of the contaminated batch "
"from your supply chain."
msgstr ""
"ກວດສອບຢືນຢັນຄຳສັ່ງຕັດເສຍ "
"ເພື່ອຮັບປະກັນການແຍກຊຸດສິນຄ້າທີ່ມີການປົນເປື້ອນອອກຈາກຕ່ອງໂສ້ການສະໜອງຂອງທ່ານຢ່າງສິ້ນເຊີງ."

#. module: food_distribution
#: model:product.template,name:food_distribution.product_template_4
msgid "Vinegar"
msgstr "ສົ້ມສາຍຊູ"

#. module: food_distribution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:food_distribution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"We take the example of the mayonnaise here.<br/>Instead of producing buckets "
"when your customers ask for it, you anticipate the trends over the coming "
"weeks and months to always have some available and smoothen the production "
"workload."
msgstr ""
"ພວກເຮົາຂໍຍົກຕົວຢ່າງມາຢອນເນສຢູ່ນີ້.<br/>ແທນທີ່ຈະຜະລິດເປັນຖັງເມື່ອລູກຄ້າສັ່ງຊື້ເຂົ້າມາ, "
"ທ່ານຄາດຄະເນທ່າອ່ຽງລ່ວງໜ້າສຳລັບຫຼາຍອາທິດ ແລະ ຫຼາຍເດືອນຂ້າງໜ້າ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ມີສິນຄ້າພ້ອມສົ່ງຢູ່ສະເໝີ ແລະ "
"ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ພາລະວຽກການຜະລິດດຳເນີນໄປຢ່າງຕໍ່ເນື່ອງ."

#. module: food_distribution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:food_distribution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"When hovering the on the Order button for a product Replenishment, a cell is "
"highlighted.\n"
"        Clicking this button orders the corresponding product for that "
"period according to the\n"
"        Replenishment input.<br/>This creates a manufacturing order or a "
"purchase order depending\n"
"        on the product configuration."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອເອົາເມົ້າໄປຊີ້ໃສ່ປຸ່ມ ສັ່ງຊື້ ສຳລັບການຕື່ມສະຕັອກສິນຄ້າ, ຫ້ອງຕາຕະລາງຈະຖືກເນັ້ນສີຂຶ້ນ.\n"
"        ການຄລິກປຸ່ມນີ້ຈະສັ່ງຊື້ສິນຄ້າທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງສຳລັບໄລຍະເວລານັ້ນຕາມຂໍ້ມູນການຕື່ມ\n"
"        ສະຕັອກທີ່ປ້ອນໄວ້.<br/>ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະສ້າງໃບສັ່ງຜະລິດ ຫຼື ໃບສັ່ງຊື້ ໂດຍຂຶ້ນກັບ\n"
"        ການກຳນົດຄ່າຂອງສິນຄ້າ."

#. module: food_distribution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:food_distribution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"When the truck arrives and you add those to your stock, validate the "
"delivery to update\n"
"        your stock levels. Don't forget to set the Lot reference in the "
"details of the delivery\n"
"        lines. You're now ready to product Mayonnaise for some time!"
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອລົດບັນທຸກມາຮອດ ແລະ ທ່ານຮັບສິນຄ້າເຂົ້າສາງ, ໃຫ້ກວດສອບຢືນຢັນການຈັດສົ່ງເພື່ອປັບປຸງ\n"
"        ລະດັບສິນຄ້າໃນສາງຂອງທ່ານ. ຢ່າລືມກຳນົດເລກອ້າງອີງຊຸດສິນຄ້າ ໃນລາຍລະອຽດຂອງແຖວ\n"
"        ການຈັດສົ່ງ. ຕອນນີ້ທ່ານພ້ອມແລ້ວທີ່ຈະຜະລິດມາຢອນເນສໄປອີກໄລຍະໜຶ່ງ!"

#. module: food_distribution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:food_distribution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"While you are using <strong>Inventory App</strong>, open the product catalog "
"from the\n"
"        Products menu. This gives you a more comprehensive view of the "
"different products you\n"
"        manipulate."
msgstr ""
"ໃນຂະນະທີ່ທ່ານກຳລັງນຳໃຊ້ <strong>ແອັບສາງສິນຄ້າ</strong>, ໃຫ້ເປີດລາຍການສິນຄ້າຈາກ\n"
"        ເມນູ ສິນຄ້າ. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານເຫັນພາບລວມທີ່ຄົບຖ້ວນຂຶ້ນກ່ຽວກັບສິນຄ້າຕ່າງໆທີ່ທ່ານ\n"
"        ຈັດການ."

#. module: food_distribution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:food_distribution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Working on your pricing to optimize your margin? You leverage the \"Compute "
"Price from\n"
"          BoM\" action available from the Product form or any Products list."
msgstr ""
"ກຳລັງຕັ້ງລາຄາເພື່ອເພີ່ມກຳໄລຂອງທ່ານຢູ່ບໍ? ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ \"ຄຳນວນລາຄາຈາກ\n"
"          BoM\" ທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃນຟອມສິນຄ້າ ຫຼື ລາຍການສິນຄ້າໃດກໍໄດ້."

#. module: food_distribution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:food_distribution.welcome_article_body
msgid "Would you like to discuss your Odoo setup with us or go even further?"
msgstr "ທ່ານຕ້ອງການປຶກສາການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Odoo ກັບພວກເຮົາ ຫຼື ພັດທະນາຂຶ້ນຕື່ມອີກບໍ່?"

#. module: food_distribution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:food_distribution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You are ready to sign your first customers? To do so, open the Sales App, "
"create a new\n"
"        order and the customer."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານພ້ອມທີ່ຈະເຊັນສັນຍາກັບລູກຄ້າກຸ່ມທຳອິດຂອງທ່ານແລ້ວບໍ? ເພື່ອເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ໃຫ້ເປີດແອັບການຂາຍ, ສ້າງ\n"
"        ຄຳສັ່ງຊື້ໃໝ່ ແລະ ລູກຄ້າໃໝ່."

#. module: food_distribution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:food_distribution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You can access every installed App in your Odoo database on your main "
"dashboard."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງທຸກໆແອັບທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງແລ້ວໃນຖານຂໍ້ມູນ Odoo ຂອງທ່ານໄດ້ທີ່ໜ້າຫຼັກ."

#. module: food_distribution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:food_distribution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You can easily maintain from here for each product its list of ingredients, "
"the nutritional facts and specific notes to add to the label."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດຈັດການລາຍການສ່ວນປະກອບ, ຂໍ້ມູນໂພຊະນາການ ແລະ ໝາຍເຫດສະເພາະສຳລັບແຕ່ລະສິນຄ້າ "
"ເພື່ອເພີ່ມໃສ່ໃນສະຫຼາກໄດ້ຢ່າງງ່າຍດາຍຈາກບ່ອນນີ້."

#. module: food_distribution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:food_distribution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You can now hurry to manufacture the needed products, deliver them prior "
"sending the invoice\n"
"      to bill your customer."
msgstr ""
"ຕອນນີ້ທ່ານສາມາດເລັ່ງຜະລິດສິນຄ້າທີ່ຕ້ອງການ, ຈັດສົ່ງສິນຄ້າກ່ອນ ແລ້ວຈຶ່ງສົ່ງໃບແຈ້ງໜີ້\n"
"      ເພື່ອຮຽກເກັບເງິນນຳລູກຄ້າຂອງທ່ານ."

#. module: food_distribution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:food_distribution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You can see that the replenishment for the Mayonnaise comes as multiple of "
"the batch\n"
"          size. You can adjust this editing the Mayonnaise Production "
"Schedule from the pen icon\n"
"          near its name."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດເຫັນໄດ້ວ່າການຕື່ມສະຕັອກສຳລັບມາຢອນເນສຈະເພີ່ມຂຶ້ນຕາມຈຳນວນທະວີຄູນຂອງຂະໜາດ\n"
"          ຊຸດ. ທ່ານສາມາດປັບປ່ຽນໄດ້ໂດຍການແກ້ໄຂຕາຕະລາງການຜະລິດມາຢອນເນສ ຈາກໄອຄອນຮູບສໍ\n"
"          ຢູ່ໃກ້ກັບຊື່."

#. module: food_distribution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:food_distribution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You can see the forecast clicking the chart icon. Down below, you can see "
"that this is\n"
"          the\n"
"          outcome of all the planned Manufacturing Orders..."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດເບິ່ງການຄາດຄະເນໄດ້ໂດຍການຄລິກໄອຄອນຮູບແຜນພູມ. ຢູ່ດ້ານລຸ່ມ, ທ່ານຈະເຫັນວ່າສິ່ງນີ້ແມ່ນ\n"
"          ຜົນລັບ\n"
"          ຂອງໃບສັ່ງຜະລິດທັງໝົດທີ່ໄດ້ວາງແຜນໄວ້..."

#. module: food_distribution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:food_distribution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You can see you're about to get low on Vinegar and Mustard in the Forecast."
msgstr "ທ່ານສາມາດເຫັນໄດ້ໃນການຄາດຄະເນວ່າ ສົ້ມສາຍຊູ ແລະ ມັດສະຕາດ ກຳລັງຈະໃກ້ໝົດແລ້ວ."

#. module: food_distribution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:food_distribution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You can setup your Bill of Material to reflect on you production processes "
"with or\n"
"          without steps, with embedded quality checks like in this example "
"or after a production."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າໂຄງສ້າງສິນຄ້າ (BoM) ໃຫ້ສອດຄ່ອງກັບຂະບວນການຜະລິດຂອງທ່ານ ບໍ່ວ່າຈະມີ\n"
"          ຫຼື ບໍ່ມີຂັ້ນຕອນ, ພ້ອມທັງການກວດສອບຄຸນນະພາບໃນລະຫວ່າງຂະບວນການດັ່ງຕົວຢ່າງນີ້ ຫຼື "
"ຫຼັງການຜະລິດ."

#. module: food_distribution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:food_distribution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You completed that demo use case! There are millions of other ways to adapt "
"your Odoo\n"
"          setup to fit your business needs."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານໄດ້ສຳເລັດກໍລະນີນຳໃຊ້ຕົວຢ່າງນີ້ແລ້ວ! ຍັງມີອີກຫຼາຍໆວິທີໃນການປັບແຕ່ງ Odoo\n"
"          ຂອງທ່ານໃຫ້ເໝາະສົມກັບຄວາມຕ້ອງການທາງທຸລະກິດ."

#. module: food_distribution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:food_distribution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You didn't import demo data? You can still do it. Go to Apps &gt; Industries "
"&gt; Upgrade\n"
"          your Food Distribution package and check the related box"
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ນຳເຂົ້າຂໍ້ມູນຕົວຢ່າງເທື່ອບໍ? ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ຢູ່. ໄປທີ່ ແອັບ &gt; ກຸ່ມອຸດສາຫະກຳ &gt; "
"ອັບເກຣດ\n"
"          ແພັກເກດການແຈກຢາຍອາຫານຂອງທ່ານ ແລ້ວໝາຍຕິກໃສ່ຫ້ອງທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ"

#. module: food_distribution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:food_distribution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You just installed the Odoo for <strong>Food distribution</strong> package. "
"By doing so, we\n"
"      have installed a bunch of necessary apps to run your business "
"efficiently."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານຫາກໍ່ຕິດຕັ້ງແພັກເກດ Odoo ສຳລັບ <strong>ການແຈກຢາຍອາຫານ</strong>. ລະບົບໄດ້ຕິດຕັ້ງ\n"
"      ບັນດາແອັບທີ່ຈຳເປັນ ເພື່ອດຳເນີນທຸລະກິດຂອງທ່ານໄດ້ຢ່າງມີປະສິດທິພາບ."

#. module: food_distribution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:food_distribution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You might distribute different types of products, shelf-stable and "
"perishable, and therefore we have different ways to help you with "
"<strong>Manufacturing App</strong>."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານອາດຈະແຈກຢາຍສິນຄ້າຫຼາຍປະເພດ ທັງສິນຄ້າທີ່ເກັບຮັກສາໄດ້ດົນ ແລະ ສິນຄ້າທີ່ເສຍງ່າຍ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນ "
"ພວກເຮົາຈຶ່ງມີຫຼາຍວິທີທີ່ຈະຊ່ວຍທ່ານດ້ວຍ <strong>ແອັບການຜະລິດ</strong>."

#. module: food_distribution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:food_distribution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You might have tested this package with or without demo data. In any case, "
"you may have\n"
"      written records in journals which are not deletable and which might be "
"an issue for your\n"
"      traceability."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານອາດຈະໄດ້ທົດສອບແພັກເກດນີ້ໂດຍມີ ຫຼື ບໍ່ມີຂໍ້ມູນຕົວຢ່າງ. ບໍ່ວ່າໃນກໍລະນີໃດ, ທ່ານອາດຈະມີການ\n"
"      ບັນທຶກລົງໃນບັນຊີປະຈຳວັນເຊິ່ງບໍ່ສາມາດລຶບໄດ້ ແລະ ອາດສົ່ງຜົນກະທົບຕໍ່ການຕິດຕາມ\n"
"      ຍ້ອນກັບຂອງທ່ານ."

#. module: food_distribution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:food_distribution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You registered your first lot of Mayonnaise. Note that it is possible to "
"change the lot\n"
"          number prefix from the product form, in the Inventory tab."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານໄດ້ລົງທະບຽນຊຸດມາຢອນເນສຊຸດທຳອິດຂອງທ່ານແລ້ວ. ໃຫ້ສັງເກດວ່າທ່ານສາມາດປ່ຽນຄຳນຳໜ້າເລກ\n"
"          ຊຸດໄດ້ຈາກຟອມສິນຄ້າ, ໃນແທັບ ສາງສິນຄ້າ."

#. module: food_distribution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:food_distribution.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You should be able to execute the following flows to have an overview of "
"various flows you\n"
"      can quickly execute with this package using Odoo."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານຄວນຈະສາມາດດຳເນີນການຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນຕໍ່ໄປນີ້ ເພື່ອເບິ່ງພາບລວມຂອງຂະບວນການຕ່າງໆ\n"
"      ທີ່ທ່ານສາມາດປະຕິບັດໄດ້ຢ່າງວ່ອງໄວດ້ວຍແພັກເກດນີ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ Odoo."

